.TH NEW-DEVLOREKEYVAULTS 1 "2026-09-07" "Noble Factor" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
New-DevloreKeyVaults \- create the Azure Key Vaults for the devlore environments
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B New-DevloreKeyVaults
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
For each devlore environment
.RB ( dev ,
.BR stg ,
.BR prd )
.B New-DevloreKeyVaults
ensures the resource group
.BR rg\-nbf\-devlore\-<env> ,
the Key Vault
.B kv\-nbf\-devlore\-<env>
with RBAC authorization and 90-day retention, and a
.B Key Vault Administrator
assignment for the signed-in user, in
.BR westus2 .
Every step is idempotent: what exists is reported, not recreated.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show this manual page and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Every vault exists with its assignment.
.TP
.B 64
Usage error.
.TP
.B 69
The Azure CLI is not installed.
.TP
.B 78
Not running on Linux or macOS.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR az (1)
.SH LICENSE
Apache-2.0.
